[{"location":"Constants/#LensFactory.Constants","page":"Constants","title":"LensFactory.Constants","text":"Constants\n\nTesting :-)\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"module"},{"location":"Constants/#Natural-constants","page":"Constants","title":"Natural constants","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"Constants/","page":"Constants","title":"Constants","text":"CONST_C = 299792458.0                        # meters/s\nCONST_G = 6.6743E-11                         # m^3 kg/s^2","category":"page"},{"location":"Constants/#Solar-constants","page":"Constants","title":"Solar constants","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"Constants/","page":"Constants","title":"Constants","text":"MASS_SUN = 1.98855E+30                       # kg\nRADIUS_SUN = 696340E+03                      # meters\nLUMINOSITY_SUN = 3.828E26                    # Watts = Joule/s","category":"page"},{"location":"Constants/#Distance-units","page":"Constants","title":"Distance units","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"Constants/","page":"Constants","title":"Constants","text":"DIST_PC = 3.0856775714409184E+16             # meters\nDIST_KPC = 3.0856775714409184E+19            # meters\nDIST_MPC = 3.0856775714409184E+22            # meters\nDIST_GPC = 3.0856775714409184E+25            # meters","category":"page"},{"location":"Constants/#Angular-units","page":"Constants","title":"Angular units","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"Constants/","page":"Constants","title":"Constants","text":"ANGLE_MICROARCSEC= 4.848136811095361E-12     # radians\nANGLE_MILLIARCSEC= 4.84813681109536E-09      # radians\nANGLE_ARCSEC = 4.84813681109536E-06          # radians\nANGLE_ARCMIN = 0.0002908882086657216         # radians\nANGLE_DEGREE = 0.017453292519943295          # radians","category":"page"},{"location":"Constants/#Temporal-units","page":"Constants","title":"Temporal units","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"Constants/","page":"Constants","title":"Constants","text":"YEAR2SECOND = 31557600.0                     # Seconds in a year\nYEAR2HOUR = 8766.0                           # Hours in a year\nYEAR2DAY = 365.25                            # Days in a year\nDAY2HOUR = 24.0                              # Hours in a day\nDAY2SECOND = 86400.0                         # Seconds in a day","category":"page"},{"location":"Cosmology/#LensFactory.Cosmology","page":"Cosmology","title":"LensFactory.Cosmology","text":"Cosmology\n\nTesting :-)\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"module"},{"location":"Cosmology/#Module-Index","page":"Cosmology","title":"Module Index","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"Cosmology/","page":"Cosmology","title":"Cosmology","text":"Modules = [Cosmology]\nOrder   = [:constant, :type, :function, :macro]","category":"page"},{"location":"Cosmology/#Initialization","page":"Cosmology","title":"Initialization","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"Cosmology/#LensFactory.Cosmology.init_cosmology","page":"Cosmology","title":"LensFactory.Cosmology.init_cosmology","text":"init_cosmology(H0::RV=70.0, w::RV=-1.0, Omega_m0::RV=0.3, Omega_r0::RV=0.0, Omega_w0::RV=0.7)\n\nAn Abstract type to initialize a given cosmology.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"type"},{"location":"Cosmology/#Basics","page":"Cosmology","title":"Basics","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"Cosmology/#LensFactory.Cosmology.scale_factor","page":"Cosmology","title":"LensFactory.Cosmology.scale_factor","text":"scale_factor(z::RV)::RV\n\nCalculates the scale factor, a, at redshift, z, which is given as\n\na = 1  (1+z)\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"Cosmology/#LensFactory.Cosmology.Ez","page":"Cosmology","title":"LensFactory.Cosmology.Ez","text":"Ez(z::RV)::RV\n\nCalculates the dimensionless Hubble parameter, E(z), at redshift, z, which is given as,\n\nE(z) = sqrt Omega_m0 (1+z)^2 + Omega_r0 (1+z)^4 + Omega_k0 (1+z)^2 + Omega_w0 (1+z)^3(1+w) \n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"Cosmology/#LensFactory.Cosmology.hubble_parameter","page":"Cosmology","title":"LensFactory.Cosmology.hubble_parameter","text":"hubble_parameter(cosmology::AbstractCosmology, z::RV)::RV\n\nCalculates the Hubble parameter, H(z) = H_0E(z), at redshift z\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"Cosmology/#Time","page":"Cosmology","title":"Time","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"Cosmology/#LensFactory.Cosmology.hubble_time","page":"Cosmology","title":"LensFactory.Cosmology.hubble_time","text":"hubble_time(H0::RV)::RV\n\nCalculates the Hubble time, t_H, (in Gyr), which is given as,\n\nt_H = 1  rm H_0\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"Cosmology/#LensFactory.Cosmology.age","page":"Cosmology","title":"LensFactory.Cosmology.age","text":"age(cosmo::AbstractCosmology, z::RV)::RV\n\nCalculates the age, t_rm age, (in Gyr) of the Universe at redshift, z, which is given as,\n\nt_rm age(z) = int_z^infty frac1(1+z)H(z) dz \n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"Cosmology/#LensFactory.Cosmology.lookback_time","page":"Cosmology","title":"LensFactory.Cosmology.lookback_time","text":"lookback_time(cosmology::AbstractCosmology, z::RV)::RV\n\nCalculates lookbak time, t_L(z) for a given redshift z, which is given as,\n\nt_L(z) = int_0^z frac1(1+z)H(z) dz \n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"Cosmology/#Density-parameters","page":"Cosmology","title":"Density parameters","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"Cosmology/#LensFactory.Cosmology.rho_cz","page":"Cosmology","title":"LensFactory.Cosmology.rho_cz","text":"rho_cz(cosmology, z)\n\nCalculates the critical density of the Universe at redshift z\n\nFormula: rho_c(z) = frac3 H^2(z)8 pi rm G `\n\nArguments\n\ncosmology::AbstractCosmology: Cosmology instance\nz::Union{Int64, Float64}: Input redshift\n\nReturns\n\nUnion{Int64, Float64}: Critical density at redshift z\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"Cosmology/#LensFactory.Cosmology.Omega_mz","page":"Cosmology","title":"LensFactory.Cosmology.Omega_mz","text":"Omega_mz(cosmology, z)\n\nCalculates the matter density parameter at redshift z.\n\nFormula: Omega_mz = Omega_m0 (1+z)^3 left( fracH0H(z) right)^2\n\nArguments\n\ncosmology::AbstractCosmology: Cosmology instance\nz::Union{Int64, Float64}: Input redshift\n\nReturns\n\nUnion{Int64, Float64}: Matter density parameter at redshift z\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"Cosmology/#LensFactory.Cosmology.Omega_rz","page":"Cosmology","title":"LensFactory.Cosmology.Omega_rz","text":"Omega_rz(cosmology, z)\n\nCalculates the radiation density parameter at redshift z\n\nFormula: Omega_rz = Omega_r0 (1+z)^4 left( fracH_0H(z) right)^2\n\nArguments\n\ncosmology::AbstractCosmology: Cosmology instance\nz::Union{Int64, Float64}: Input redshift\n\nReturns\n\nUnion{Int64, Float64}: Radiation density parameter at redshift z\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"Cosmology/#LensFactory.Cosmology.Omega_wz","page":"Cosmology","title":"LensFactory.Cosmology.Omega_wz","text":"Omega_wz(cosmology, z)\n\nCalculates the dark energy density parameter at redshift z\n\nFormula: Omega_wz = Omega_w0 (1+z)^3(1+w) left( fracH_0H(z) right)^2\n\nArguments\n\ncosmology::AbstractCosmology: Cosmology instance\nz::Union{Int64, Float64}: Input redshift\n\nReturns\n\nUnion{Int64, Float64}: Dark energy density parameter at redshift z\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"Cosmology/#LensFactory.Cosmology.Omega_kz","page":"Cosmology","title":"LensFactory.Cosmology.Omega_kz","text":"Omega_kz(cosmology, z)\n\nCalculates the curvature density parameter at redshift z.\n\nFormula: Omega_kz = Omega_k0 (1+z)^2 left( fracH_0H(z) right)^2\n\nArguments\n\ncosmology::AbstractCosmology: Cosmology instance\nz::Union{Int64, Float64}: Input redshift\n\nReturns\n\nUnion{Int64, Float64}: Curvature density parameter at redshift z\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"Cosmology/#Distances","page":"Cosmology","title":"Distances","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"Cosmology/#LensFactory.Cosmology.hubble_distance","page":"Cosmology","title":"LensFactory.Cosmology.hubble_distance","text":"hubble_distance(H0)\n\nCalculates radius of the observable Universe.\n\nFormula: R_H = crm H_0\n\nArguments\n\nH0::Union{Int64, Float64}: Hubble constant, in km/s/Mpc\n\nReturns\n\nUnion{Int64, Float64}: Radius of the observable Universe, in meters \n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"Cosmology/#LensFactory.Cosmology.distance_modulus","page":"Cosmology","title":"LensFactory.Cosmology.distance_modulus","text":"distance_modulus(cosmology, z)\n\nCalculates the distance modulus to a given redshift z\n\nFormula: mu = 5 log(d_Lrm pc) - 5\n\nArguments\n\ncosmology::AbstractCosmology: Cosmology instance\nz::Union{Int64, Float64}: Input redshift\n\nReturns\n\nUnion{Int64, Float64}: Distance modulus to a redshift z\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"Cosmology/#LensFactory.Cosmology.angular_scale","page":"Cosmology","title":"LensFactory.Cosmology.angular_scale","text":"angular_scale(cosmo::AbstractCosmology, zf::RV)::RV\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"Cosmology/#Volumes","page":"Cosmology","title":"Volumes","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"Cosmology/#LensFactory.Cosmology.comoving_volume_element","page":"Cosmology","title":"LensFactory.Cosmology.comoving_volume_element","text":"comovingvolumeelement(cosmology, z)\n\nCalculates the comving volume element at redshift z, in Gpc^3.\n\nFormula: $ dV = dH \\frac{D_M^2}{E(z)} $\n\nArguments\n\ncosmology::AbstractCosmology: Cosmology instance\nz::Union{Int64, Float64}: Input redshift\n\nReturns\n\nUnion{Int64, Float64}: Comoving volume element at redshift z, in Gpc^3\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"Cosmology/#LensFactory.Cosmology.comoving_volume","page":"Cosmology","title":"LensFactory.Cosmology.comoving_volume","text":"comoving_volume(cosmology, z)\n\nCalculates the comving volume element at redshift z\n\nFormula: $ dV = dH \\frac{D_M^2}{E(z)} $\n\nArguments\n\ncosmology::AbstractCosmology: Cosmology instance\nz::Union{Int64, Float64}: Redshift\n\nReturns\n\nUnion{Int64, Float64}: Comoving volume element at redshift z, in Gpc^3\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"#LensFactory.jl","page":"Home","title":"LensFactory.jl","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"","page":"Home","title":"Home","text":"Documentation for LensFactory.jl","category":"page"},{"location":"#LensFactory","page":"Home","title":"LensFactory","text":"LensFactory\n\nTesting :-)\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"module"}]
